  "ingredients": [
    "4 tablespoons butter, divided",
    "6 ounces fresh mushrooms, sliced",
    "1 medium onion, chopped",
    "1 (12 ounce) package egg noodles",
    "2 pounds lean ground beef",
    "0.25 cup all-purpose flour",
    "2 cups beef broth",
    "1 cup sour cream",
    "salt and black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/A5pSL0CvPmVLbs2mDDw2f_TyLVY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11880-Easy-Beef-Stroganoff-ddmfs-step-1-016-9ab1f97e6a9a49c19cf0c848bd0aaf38.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11880/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt 2 tablespoons butter in a large skillet over medium heat. Add mushrooms and onion; cook and stir until soft, about 5 minutes. Transfer to a bowl; do not clean the skillet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7ILg9eN4bmdHid9kH3wScTiZsRg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11880-Easy-Beef-Stroganoff-ddmfs-step-3-089-3ab25b4b0a4b41fab42fe3ae7b606c9a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11880/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill a large pot with lightly salted water and bring to a rapid boil. Cook egg noodles at a boil until tender yet firm to the bite, 7 to 9 minutes. Drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7Zx6-BLzbsEI-f81NL5RbQjD7Gs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11880-Easy-Beef-Stroganoff-ddmfs-step-2-017-04feeac756604fe1964a5c6f340aa5c2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11880/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the noodles are cooking, melt remaining 2 tablespoons butter in the skillet over medium heat. Add ground beef and sauté until browned and crumbly, 7 to 9 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SvSe4Sr0UlBcMn6S9CGl7pWzIEo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11880-Easy-Beef-Stroganoff-ddmfs-step-4-098-1838dc33ae6542c4a686cef4fdd60f32.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11880/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in flour and cook for 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xJAOXXro6Hz9acyHLesfWWpNHLU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11880-Easy-Beef-Stroganoff-ddmfs-step-5-099-5bbe161ce2ec416baab7a2e1d925ace4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11880/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in broth and cook until slightly thickened, 2 to 4 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eKLHUPEO2naKTv-Vu85vwMyx2HA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11880-Easy-Beef-Stroganoff-ddmfs-step-6-105-4046dc4974924eeb855b4d5a685ca3cf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11880/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add mushroom mixture, then stir in sour cream, salt, and pepper. Cook, stirring occasionally until sauce is hot, 2 to 3 minutes; do not boil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-ZzFIqCM4IhrNV0ypZsMSXb_a-8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11880-Easy-Beef-Stroganoff-ddmfs-4x3-170-097ac13f46c84a2fbed8d8d073c96d85.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11880/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
